{"real": true, "dur": 121.76, "sent": [{"start": 0.18, "end": 2.52, "text": "This is where FluOLinGo began.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 0.18}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.38}, {"w": "where", "s": 0.56}, {"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 1.24}, {"w": "began.", "s": 2.06}]}, {"start": 3.52, "end": 8.22, "text": "It teaches beginner French using our course book, L’Atelier.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 3.52}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 3.72}, {"w": "beginner", "s": 4.42}, {"w": "French", "s": 4.88}, {"w": "using", "s": 5.74}, {"w": "our", "s": 6.12}, {"w": "course", "s": 6.36}, {"w": "book,", "s": 6.68}, {"w": "La-tuh-li-eh.", "s": 7.36}]}, {"start": 8.7, "end": 16.8, "text": "In the first version, I cut the course into fifty small goals across five units and laid them out on a map.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 8.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.82}, {"w": "first", "s": 9.0}, {"w": "version,", "s": 9.3}, {"w": "I", "s": 10.34}, {"w": "cut", "s": 10.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.74}, {"w": "course", "s": 10.9}, {"w": "into", "s": 11.4}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 11.84}, {"w": "small", "s": 12.44}, {"w": "goals", "s": 12.82}, {"w": "across", "s": 13.32}, {"w": "five", "s": 13.86}, {"w": "units", "s": 14.28}, {"w": "and", "s": 15.14}, {"w": "laid", "s": 15.38}, {"w": "them", "s": 15.64}, {"w": "out", "s": 15.88}, {"w": "on", "s": 16.26}, {"w": "a", "s": 16.4}, {"w": "map.", "s": 16.52}]}, {"start": 17.68, "end": 23.28, "text": "That’s the left side of the slide: fifty numbered goals in a row.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 17.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.02}, {"w": "left", "s": 18.16}, {"w": "side", "s": 18.46}, {"w": "of", "s": 19.04}, {"w": "the", "s": 19.18}, {"w": "slide:", "s": 19.32}, {"w": "fifty", "s": 20.62}, {"w": "numbered", "s": 21.62}, {"w": "goals", "s": 22.06}, {"w": "in", "s": 22.76}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.88}, {"w": "row.", "s": 22.98}]}, {"start": 24.28, "end": 27.02, "text": "Every exercise belonged to a goal.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 24.28}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 24.7}, {"w": "belonged", "s": 25.82}, {"w": "to", "s": 26.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 26.62}, {"w": "goal.", "s": 26.76}]}, {"start": 27.48, "end": 32.58, "text": "In other words, I started with the goal, then built the exercises around it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 27.48}, {"w": "other", "s": 27.7}, {"w": "words,", "s": 27.96}, {"w": "I", "s": 28.84}, {"w": "started", "s": 28.96}, {"w": "with", "s": 29.36}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.54}, {"w": "goal,", "s": 29.68}, {"w": "then", "s": 30.5}, {"w": "built", "s": 30.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 31.1}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 31.3}, {"w": "around", "s": 32.1}, {"w": "it.", "s": 32.4}]}, {"start": 32.96, "end": 34.62, "text": "But look at three of those goals.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 32.96}, {"w": "look", "s": 33.18}, {"w": "at", "s": 33.36}, {"w": "three", "s": 33.52}, {"w": "of", "s": 33.78}, {"w": "those", "s": 33.94}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 34.24}]}, {"start": 35.12, "end": 38.34, "text": "Number twenty-eight, negation, is linguistic.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "twenty-eight,", "s": 35.46}, {"w": "negation,", "s": 36.54}, {"w": "is", "s": 37.44}, {"w": "linguistic.", "s": 37.66}]}, {"start": 38.76, "end": 45.8, "text": "Number twenty-nine, inviting someone and turning down an invitation, is communicative.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 38.76}, {"w": "twenty-nine,", "s": 39.1}, {"w": "inviting", "s": 40.44}, {"w": "someone", "s": 41.18}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.84}, {"w": "turning", "s": 42.1}, {"w": "down", "s": 42.52}, {"w": "an", "s": 42.86}, {"w": "invitation,", "s": 43.1}, {"w": "is", "s": 44.48}, {"w": "communicative.", "s": 44.84}]}, {"start": 46.84, "end": 51.2, "text": "Number thirty, writing an email, is a whole task.", "words": [{"w": "Number", "s": 46.84}, {"w": "thirty,", "s": 47.14}, {"w": "writing", "s": 48.14}, {"w": "an", "s": 48.7}, {"w": "email,", "s": 49.0}, {"w": "is", "s": 50.0}, {"w": "a", "s": 50.32}, {"w": "whole", "s": 50.5}, {"w": "task.", "s": 50.8}]}, {"start": 51.54, "end": 56.7, "text": "On the map, though, all three looked exactly the same: one stop each.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 51.54}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.68}, {"w": "map,", "s": 51.82}, {"w": "though,", "s": 52.52}, {"w": "all", "s": 53.32}, {"w": "three", "s": 53.52}, {"w": "looked", "s": 53.9}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 54.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.86}, {"w": "same:", "s": 55.04}, {"w": "one", "s": 55.8}, {"w": "stop", "s": 56.08}, {"w": "each.", "s": 56.42}]}, {"start": 57.54, "end": 61.04, "text": "And that was a problem, because they are not the same kind of thing.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 57.54}, {"w": "that", "s": 57.76}, {"w": "was", "s": 57.96}, {"w": "a", "s": 58.14}, {"w": "problem,", "s": 58.24}, {"w": "because", "s": 59.02}, {"w": "they", "s": 59.38}, {"w": "are", "s": 59.56}, {"w": "not", "s": 59.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 59.94}, {"w": "same", "s": 60.12}, {"w": "kind", "s": 60.4}, {"w": "of", "s": 60.62}, {"w": "thing.", "s": 60.76}]}, {"start": 61.68, "end": 63.96, "text": "Negation is one small building block.", "words": [{"w": "Negation", "s": 61.68}, {"w": "is", "s": 62.36}, {"w": "one", "s": 62.66}, {"w": "small", "s": 62.98}, {"w": "building", "s": 63.3}, {"w": "block.", "s": 63.64}]}, {"start": 64.3, "end": 68.86, "text": "Writing an email is a whole piece of work that needs many of those blocks.", "words": [{"w": "Writing", "s": 64.3}, {"w": "an", "s": 64.68}, {"w": "email", "s": 64.959}, {"w": "is", "s": 65.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 65.6}, {"w": "whole", "s": 65.76}, {"w": "piece", "s": 66.08}, {"w": "of", "s": 66.34}, {"w": "work", "s": 66.52}, {"w": "that", "s": 67.18}, {"w": "needs", "s": 67.38}, {"w": "many", "s": 67.68}, {"w": "of", "s": 68.0}, {"w": "those", "s": 68.12}, {"w": "blocks.", "s": 68.4}]}, {"start": 69.58, "end": 76.76, "text": "So a learner moving along the map could not tell a small step from a big one, or see which goals the email depended on.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 69.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 69.8}, {"w": "learner", "s": 69.9}, {"w": "moving", "s": 70.28}, {"w": "along", "s": 70.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 70.92}, {"w": "map", "s": 71.08}, {"w": "could", "s": 71.74}, {"w": "not", "s": 71.9}, {"w": "tell", "s": 72.16}, {"w": "a", "s": 72.4}, {"w": "small", "s": 72.56}, {"w": "step", "s": 72.86}, {"w": "from", "s": 73.14}, {"w": "a", "s": 73.34}, {"w": "big", "s": 73.44}, {"w": "one,", "s": 73.7}, {"w": "or", "s": 74.46}, {"w": "see", "s": 74.62}, {"w": "which", "s": 74.84}, {"w": "goals", "s": 75.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 75.52}, {"w": "email", "s": 75.74}, {"w": "depended", "s": 76.06}, {"w": "on.", "s": 76.56}]}, {"start": 77.1, "end": 87.54, "text": "At first, I didn’t notice this, because I was simply following the French book, which already sorts its content into situations and tasks.", "words": [{"w": "At", "s": 77.1}, {"w": "first,", "s": 77.34}, {"w": "I", "s": 78.2}, {"w": "didn’t", "s": 78.32}, {"w": "notice", "s": 78.6}, {"w": "this,", "s": 79.02}, {"w": "because", "s": 79.86}, {"w": "I", "s": 80.48}, {"w": "was", "s": 80.58}, {"w": "simply", "s": 80.82}, {"w": "following", "s": 81.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 81.84}, {"w": "French", "s": 82.06}, {"w": "book,", "s": 82.52}, {"w": "which", "s": 83.32}, {"w": "already", "s": 83.78}, {"w": "sorts", "s": 84.3}, {"w": "its", "s": 84.78}, {"w": "content", "s": 85.06}, {"w": "into", "s": 85.62}, {"w": "situations", "s": 85.98}, {"w": "and", "s": 86.88}, {"w": "tasks.", "s": 87.1}]}, {"start": 87.94, "end": 92.2, "text": "But when I started planning the Chinese version, that support was gone.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 87.94}, {"w": "when", "s": 88.12}, {"w": "I", "s": 88.42}, {"w": "started", "s": 88.56}, {"w": "planning", "s": 89.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 89.34}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 89.48}, {"w": "version,", "s": 89.9}, {"w": "that", "s": 90.92}, {"w": "support", "s": 91.14}, {"w": "was", "s": 91.58}, {"w": "gone.", "s": 91.82}]}, {"start": 93.04, "end": 96.6, "text": "The Chinese book has no situations and no tasks at all.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 93.04}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 93.2}, {"w": "book", "s": 93.62}, {"w": "has", "s": 93.82}, {"w": "no", "s": 94.08}, {"w": "situations", "s": 94.3}, {"w": "and", "s": 95.18}, {"w": "no", "s": 95.4}, {"w": "tasks", "s": 95.66}, {"w": "at", "s": 96.12}, {"w": "all.", "s": 96.3}]}, {"start": 97.3, "end": 102.28, "text": "That meant I had to decide, for every step, what kind of step it was.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 97.3}, {"w": "meant", "s": 97.54}, {"w": "I", "s": 98.0}, {"w": "had", "s": 98.08}, {"w": "to", "s": 98.22}, {"w": "decide,", "s": 98.36}, {"w": "for", "s": 99.42}, {"w": "every", "s": 99.7}, {"w": "step,", "s": 100.0}, {"w": "what", "s": 100.84}, {"w": "kind", "s": 101.1}, {"w": "of", "s": 101.32}, {"w": "step", "s": 101.46}, {"w": "it", "s": 101.76}, {"w": "was.", "s": 101.9}]}, {"start": 102.74, "end": 106.2, "text": "And that is when I saw that the map was mixing three different kinds.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 102.74}, {"w": "that", "s": 102.92}, {"w": "is", "s": 103.12}, {"w": "when", "s": 103.32}, {"w": "I", "s": 103.56}, {"w": "saw", "s": 103.68}, {"w": "that", "s": 103.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 104.08}, {"w": "map", "s": 104.28}, {"w": "was", "s": 104.52}, {"w": "mixing", "s": 104.74}, {"w": "three", "s": 105.14}, {"w": "different", "s": 105.4}, {"w": "kinds.", "s": 105.74}]}, {"start": 106.78, "end": 108.68, "text": "On the right is the revised structure.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 106.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 106.9}, {"w": "right", "s": 107.08}, {"w": "is", "s": 107.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 107.58}, {"w": "revised", "s": 107.72}, {"w": "structure.", "s": 108.2}]}, {"start": 109.08, "end": 117.78, "text": "Each unit now has two kinds of goal, linguistic and communicative, and one task at the end, where learners use both together.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 109.08}, {"w": "unit", "s": 109.36}, {"w": "now", "s": 109.96}, {"w": "has", "s": 110.18}, {"w": "two", "s": 110.42}, {"w": "kinds", "s": 110.66}, {"w": "of", "s": 110.9}, {"w": "goal,", "s": 111.04}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 111.86}, {"w": "and", "s": 112.78}, {"w": "communicative,", "s": 112.94}, {"w": "and", "s": 114.28}, {"w": "one", "s": 114.52}, {"w": "task", "s": 114.74}, {"w": "at", "s": 115.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 115.34}, {"w": "end,", "s": 115.52}, {"w": "where", "s": 116.18}, {"w": "learners", "s": 116.38}, {"w": "use", "s": 116.82}, {"w": "both", "s": 117.06}, {"w": "together.", "s": 117.36}]}, {"start": 118.36, "end": 121.02, "text": "And you’ll see that same structure in both languages.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 118.36}, {"w": "you’ll", "s": 118.52}, {"w": "see", "s": 118.72}, {"w": "that", "s": 118.92}, {"w": "same", "s": 119.14}, {"w": "structure", "s": 119.44}, {"w": "in", "s": 119.96}, {"w": "both", "s": 120.14}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 120.42}]}]}